Frames in html divides browser window into various section
types of Frames
1) floating frame(inline) : showing content of another webpage here and there in current webpage we can use <iframe> tag for this
2) navigation frame : like a dashboard can have various sections or options to navigate through different webpages we can use <frame> and <frameset> tag for this
3) mixed frames : combination of both floating and navigation frames

Example of floating frame:
<iframe
src="https://www.example.com" 
width="600" 
height="400">
title="Example Frame">
</iframe>
Example of navigation frame:
<frameset rows="25%,75%">
  <frame src="navigation.html">
  <frame src="content.html">
</frameset>

